SAC Registry adapts Koda Archive's bounded transfer reader and OCI manifest,
descriptor, upload and publication logic, and the historical HTTP and filesystem
missing-blob publication workflow from Koda revision
765bb521b69d094d7eee2831bfcfaa55dc9cbfb8. Its records, validation and transports
have been adapted to sealed SAC1 snapshots and their canonical objects.
